# ── Make api call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
@When "^retrieves Cortex formula configurations for product '([^']*)'$"
    Given build request as user 'maker'
    And set path parameter 'productId' to the product ID of '$1'
    When get from path '/products/{productId}/cortex-formulas'
    And attach the response body to the report
